Author: Seyoon Ragavan <complexzetaprime@gmail.com>
Date:   Mon Oct 12 11:09:29 2026 -0400

    B4 pre-issue promotion: CNF grammar facts public in CNFEncoding; spaceUsedByTape_le_card_Icc moved to Catalog
    
    Behaviour-preserving moves; no public statement changes, every existing public name kept.
    
    - Formulas/CNFEncoding.lean: new public Std.Sat.CNF.takeTrues_repr, parseLit_repr,
      parseClause_repr, parseClauses_repr, parse_repr, syntaxStep, SyntaxSuffix,
      syntaxSuffix_cons/_nil/_run, syntaxOK, syntaxOK_spec (promoted from the private
      sat_* / satSyntax* block of ClassNP/SAT.lean); two Main-results bullets;
      adds import Mathlib.Tactic.FinCases (fin_cases).
    - ClassNP/SAT.lean: private block deleted; uses cite the public names.
    - ClassNP/Tautology.lean: private taut_{takeTrues,parseLit,parseClause,parseClauses,parse}_shape
      (verbatim duplicates of the promoted lemmas) deleted; uses cite CNF.parseLit_repr,
      CNF.parseClause_repr, CNF.parse_repr.
    - Turing.MultiTapeTM.spaceUsedByTape_le_card_Icc moved from Build/Zone.lean to
      Build/Catalog.lean (not Deterministic.lean, per coordinator revision: fewer
      downstream replays); same name, statement and docstring, flagged note added.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

